    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Sorting</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/4sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 18</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>4Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">3Sum with one more fixed loop: sort, fix the first two values (skipping repeats in each slot), and finish with a two-pointer pair search on the rest. Do the sums in 64 bits, because four values near 10<sup>9</sup> overflow an int. O(n³) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
